hoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/09/02/288180982/a6ce4c0ac6aa3778657bec0f4994f6f0_5481677665722735147.png\",\"option\":\"【关于这份丢失的快件…】——持有「歪歪扭扭的的快件」时\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呜哇！是我的，这份快件是我寄出去的！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e还好还好，我还以为我寄错地址了…要是那样的话，我就完蛋了…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e谢谢你，真的很谢谢你。这些报酬请收下吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…还有，那个…请千万不要告诉夏温小姐！拜托了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【获得\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"725\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/ec90920056d754049efb1eda9776d0b4_1571172841746578465.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"铁块\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"3\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/725/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/725/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/ec90920056d754049efb1eda9776d0b4_1571172841746578465.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e铁块\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*3\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"bit1ycx0teT1724852356509\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【有什么亮闪闪的吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e对啊，对啊，每个人都闪着不同的光，不是吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e夏温师父是蓝盈盈的，希诺宁姐姐是金灿灿的，卡齐娜则是红通通暖烘烘的…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我的话…嘿嘿，先不告诉你！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"i0id30waamfT1724852402894\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【谢谢夸奖。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不客气，欢迎多来！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"xmuug6o957iT1724852278932\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【真能看到颜色吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哼哼…不可以问这么不浪漫的问题哦？人的感受可是互通的，味道、颜色、温度，都差不多嘛。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e所以，每个人都有一种最适合自己的宝石，即使它在别人眼里只是弹珠，对你来说也可能是最特别的存在。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e夏温师父的宝石库是我见过的最——大——的，怎么样，要来找找看吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1746293325","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"693","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1210","pos":"banner"},{"id":"3885","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"694","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1211","pos":"left"},{"id":"1212","pos":"right"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"}]}]},"edit_lock_status":"Unlock","correct_lock_status":"Unlock","me